<title>BULGARIA: FRANKFURT FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 7.</title>
<headline>FRANKFURT FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 7.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The dollar was fixed at 1.8812</p>
<p>marks in Frankfurt on Thursday from 1.8873 marks on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Other main currencies are fixed against the mark at the</p>
<p>following rates (previous in brackets):</p>
<p>    USD   1.8812 (1.8873)     </p>
<p>    GBP   2.9980 (3.0167)	</p>
<p>    CHF 122.7800 (122.8800)   </p>
<p>    JPY   1.5863 (1.5828)     </p>
<p>    ATS  14.2120 (14.2120)     </p>
<p>The exchange rates are used in Bulgaria for accounting,</p>
<p>statistical and customs purposes and are valid for Friday,</p>
<p>August 8.</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 911 88</p>
